# R01 reporting repair — finite author preseal

Policy input: ROOT `ea18868e311e0841724796350b213180721e425c`, its
R01-PROFILE-DECISION.md and ROOT-OBSERVATION-ACCEPTANCE.md. Baseline is exactly
accepted R02 b5 five-file engine on recorded accepted Unit3 core7a, not HEAD.
Only matcher.ts changes. Descendant reporting is reset on a precharged owned
copy; histories/ranking remain untouched. Existing R02 checkpoint awaits remain.
No transport/shell/public API or grammar changes.

Original author E12, seven original independent R01 failures, independent17/24,
and native observations remain literal. `cases-v2.json` changes ONLY E12 values
to ["aba","a",""] and model spans to [[0,3],[2,3],null]. This follows ROOT's
project decision, not capture offsets inferred from native NUL output.

Native12 projections use authenticated accepted OBSERVATIONS.json, existing
COHORT pattern/subject inputs, status/cardinality/string values ONLY. No native
execution. N11/N12 have no populated prior state and cannot establish publication
clearing/preservation. I23 remains a62-input project property, not native-qualified
as a family. Its original52 contradictions are preserved elsewhere.

## Executable phases and counts

`node runner.mjs seal PRESEAL-01` is SOURCE/DATA only: binds five source files,
the previous b5 seal and emitted declarations,241 tooling files/exact Node22.22.2,
unchanged66-suite/eight-checkpoint/four-empty fixtures, unchanged24 independent
policy/safety bodies, native12 manifest, new fixtures and this complete runner.
It creates E12-v2/native-projection DATA before the executable seal. Commit the
source, generated cases and SEAL.json before actual `run ACTUAL-01`.

One ACTUAL run after complete preseal:35minutes inclusive cleanup/publication,
96known OS starts/peak4,128MiB combined capture/768MiB work,30s case/120s build.
Executor conservatively limits itself to40execution children, peak1 (plus owner),
64MiB capture/512MiB work,30minutes total leaving publication time.
Expected28children: one strict build;15runtime children (five cohorts ×three
layouts); six declaration consumers; six mutant/restored children.

Per layout118groups:66author with versioned E12 +8unchanged checkpoints +4unchanged
empty-fragment groups +24unchanged independent groups (includes original7 R01
controls/I23 plus17neighbors) +12native-visible projections +4targeted controls.
Thus354 unmutated layout groups, not354 native observations. Source-built,
regular-file installed internal artifact and physical-move/origin-absence layouts;
no npm/full-package/public integration claim. Each child hashes actual five
loaded-module paths and emits a complete result whose exit status must agree.
Installed copies preserve bytes/modes and declarations; all five declarations
must equal b5's bound emitted declarations. Six type groups expect three exact
negative codes TS2345/TS2339/TS2322 per layout (nine diagnostics total).

Mutants: M01 actual old b5 matcher module/N01; M02 ranking-history link removal/
E28; M03 removal only of new reset-helper checkpoint awaits/R02. Each must load
changed matcher bytes, fail its specific assertion and pass restored companion.
Two DATA admission guards exercise content drift and missing files. No loader,
Workers, transport/Shell ERE, native, guest engine, private repo, network or broad
test discovery. No compressed inputs; nothing is inflated.

Target controls: R01 branch isolation; R02 bounded300-literal reset scan observes
checkpoint charge spacing; R03 instrumented ledger rejection at reset-copy
admission (source proof, not a default-cap/RSS claim); R04 original falsy caller
reason during that admission. All asserted work is finite and budgeted.

The source helper does not change capture histories, candidate preference or
pending-state branch ownership. Extra scan/copy work legitimately consumes the
unchanged private ledger; no cap increases/refunds. Exact copied-storage and
history-isolation claims require different reviewer verification.

Outer file capture precedes fallible lookup. Spawn ownership/close observation
precedes receipt publication. Ordinary assertion failures aggregate only after
known close and intact bindings. Integrity/capture/cap/deadline/unknown-retirement
stops dependents; no retry. Administrative starts are recorded separately from
the28planned execution children, not treated as nonexistent reservations.

